From 8b7f0dfec90083acefa3b8236a35acb2635ea1ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:14:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Phase 1: rebuild directory architecture, search and
 filters

- Split page into index.html, assets/styles.css, assets/i18n.js, assets/app.js (strict CSP, no inline script)
- Schema v2 data with stable ids, source, secondSource, verifiedDate, status set incl. closed/duplicate
- Filters: tokenized search with synonyms and ZIP, state, dynamic city, category, church tradition
  shown only for Church; verified-only toggle; deep links via URL params; results grouped by city/state
- Cards: call, website, directions, status badge, last-checked date, source links, report correction, claim
- State explorer with city/category chips and 51-state coverage grid with honest empty states
- Housing board with automatic Active / Needs recheck / Expired status
- Contribution templates for business, church, professional, organization, housing, correction, claim
- Guarded localStorage, language button visible on mobile, focus styles, reduced motion
- SEO: title/description, OG/Twitter, WebSite+Organization JSON-LD, ItemList of verified listings,
  robots.txt, sitemap.xml
- tools/validate-data.js (CI), tools/test-site.js (Playwright), GitHub issue forms for review queue

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C51joV1bn4EuCSjgvACjRz
